      "content": "SP 8607               WENDOVER               SOUTH STREET                                              west side 10/283                                       Nos. 30 & 36 (even) 1/9/74 GV                                           II Terrace of 4 small houses. C19, brick except No.30 which has been rendered. Shallow slate roof. 2 brick chimneys. 2-storeys. 4 bays of 2-light casements and 4 doors, all with cambered brick arches to ground floor except No.30. Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP8682107549"
